    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SpringBootCondition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.condition\"><code>SpringBootCondition</code></a> used to check if a resource can be found using a\nconfigurable property and optional default location(s).",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SpringBootCondition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.condition\"><code>SpringBootCondition</code></a> 用于检查是否可以使用可配置属性以及可选的默认位置找到资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a> that only matches when no <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> beans of the\nspecified type are contained in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a>，仅当指定的类型的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/Filter.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>Filter</code></a> Bean 不包含在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中时匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a> that only matches when beans meeting all the specified\nrequirements are already contained in the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a> 仅在满足所有指定要求的 Bean 已包含在 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中时才匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a> that matches based on the availability of a JNDI\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.naming/javax/naming/InitialContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.naming\"><code>InitialContext</code></a> and the ability to lookup specific locations.",
