      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Conditional.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Conditional</code></a>，仅当 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中尚未包含满足指定条件的 Bean 时才会匹配。",
      "count": 2
